# PLAN-NEXT: stretch 0: test TypeTest v0 testedType=L0 before v3; test BelongsToInstance v0 before v3; test IsSlotFilled v0 key="a" receivers=[L0] level=Expected before v3; slow path leaves on b2.0; uses v3 v6; cloned 12
# PLAN-NOT: stretch
